 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5433+) **Earth2 start distribution rework:** for Huge and beyond world sizes, keep Earth2 at its existing **Huge-scale sizing** (already large enough), but solve crowding by **populating underused landmasses instead** (e.g., min 16 players before Africa is populated, min 32 players before the whole world is populated) of enlarging the script further. **Thresholds are based on player count** (not world size). See [`GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml`](/Assets/XML/GlobalDefines_advciv_sas.xml).
 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5444+) Add **Deer percentage map option** (e.g., `0/10/25/50/75/100`) for [Arboria.py](/PrivateMaps/Arboria.py) and [Boreal.py](/PrivateMaps/Boreal.py): **high-food terrain** (e.g. grass) maps like Arboria, or **lower-food terrain** ones (e.g. tundra/plains) like Boreal, had **too much deer**. See also See [KI#105](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#105---fixed-base-advciv-bug-of-most-bonuses-eg-deer-sometimes-not-appearing-at-first-civ4-launch-in-some-maps-eg-boreal).
